    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/73b51ac2afbc75c59f222af34a549b5e.poster.avif?t=1755241803\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/73b51ac2afbc75c59f222af34a549b5e.webm?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/73b51ac2afbc75c59f222af34a549b5e.mp4?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replicat</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder that bends the rules of memory matching. Build powerful decks, break conventions with game-altering items, and score high with wild strategies.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/3b54e0a44255ea6290e32c675b6022ef.poster.avif?t=1755241803\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/3b54e0a44255ea6290e32c675b6022ef.webm?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching cards is just the beginning. Stack game-breaking effects that twist the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal extra cards, keep tiles flipped, match wild Jokers, and even force mismatched pairs to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While memory helps, strategy is king as your deck grows stronger and more unpredictable.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Match cards in ways you never thought possible.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique curios that rewrite the rules of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn mistakes into opportunities with clever deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/ffa6325b14c288d8cd5c0d958a2bde85.poster.avif?t=1755241803\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/ffa6325b14c288d8cd5c0d958a2bde85.webm?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different deck archetypes to forge powerful, rule-defying strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you focus on extra moves, passive reveals, turn manipulation, multipliers or pure chaos, every build offers a unique way to outwit the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/d61c064a70bbc4fc63541a1c97196ded.poster.avif?t=1755241803\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/d61c064a70bbc4fc63541a1c97196ded.webm?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/d61c064a70bbc4fc63541a1c97196ded.mp4?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf 5 card colors, each with distinct mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e 90+ unique cards, from memory-twisting effects to reality-breaking Jokers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 80+ curios that redefine how you match and strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      \ud83e\uddea 5 essence categories with 18 upgrade types to shape your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Face 21 levels of escalating challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 Battle unique boss stages, each with its own game-changing modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 10 starter decks, each with unique set of difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce8 MORE TO COME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/4630588d29d96d809cae370e89def1bc.poster.avif?t=1755241803\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/4630588d29d96d809cae370e89def1bc.webm?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same in <strong>Replicat</strong>. Every game is packed with randomized challenges, unique modifiers, and fresh opportunities to experiment with new strategies. As you play, earn experience to unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cards to expand your deck-building options</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New starting decks for varied playstyles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Higher difficulties for even greater challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/c4d0900222e6ece0e673161f6137a876.poster.avif?t=1755241803\" width=450 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/c4d0900222e6ece0e673161f6137a876.webm?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/c4d0900222e6ece0e673161f6137a876.mp4?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Replicat\u2019s jazzy, funky world filled with adorable cat emotes, meowing sound effects, and vibrant visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re chasing high scores or crafting outrageous combos, Replicat keeps you coming back for more!</p>",
