ore_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/c4d0900222e6ece0e673161f6137a876.webm?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/c4d0900222e6ece0e673161f6137a876.mp4?t=1755241803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Replicat\u2019s jazzy, funky world filled with adorable cat emotes, meowing sound effects, and vibrant visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re chasing high scores or crafting outrageous combos, Replicat keeps you coming back for more!</p>",
